{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45524","headline":"题贾岛吟诗台 · 归仁","name":"题贾岛吟诗台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此台如可废，此恨有谁平。\n纵使迷青草，终难没旧名。\n天悲朝雨色，岳哭夜猨声。\n不是心偏苦，应关自古情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"归仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}